# port.recipe, the region this package carries, and where it comes from.
#
# Two lines, and they are the whole world Heart Gold draws: every map its own
# map headers put in Johto or in Kanto, converted into this game's field
# archives out of the player's image by `tools/portmap.py`. Nothing here is
# bytes. The bytes come from the cartridge, land in .cooked/ beside this file,
# and are not committed.
#
# BOTH REGIONS ARE ONE PACKAGE AND ONE RUN. A package's appended members must
# start at the built image's own counts and run without a gap, so two packages
# would both start there and claim the same numbers, and the doors between
# the two regions only work when both ends are in the same one. They do not
# share a matrix (Johto is 24x14 cells of the source's shared overworld and
# Kanto 23x15, but together they span 45 against the engine's 30), so each gets
# its own and crossing between them is a matrix change, which is what a door
# has always been.
#
#   <game code>  <kind>  <source name>  <destination name>
#
# A REGION HAS NO DESTINATION, which is why the fourth column is `-`. Every
# other kind in this grammar is a PAIRING, this species' sprite onto that
# one's, and a region is not: its maps are appended with addresses of their
# own, `594 + the map's own source header`, because there is no Sinnoh map for
# a Johto one to land on. Not an index over the run: an index would have moved
# every Johto map the day the Kanto line was added below it. The server derives
# the same numbers from mmo/MAPS without ever seeing this package, which is
# what makes a ported map addressable at all.
#
# WHAT CROSSES is the design notes list, and the short version is: the
# ground, the buildings, the people, the doors, the music, the text, and as
# much of each script as a world with no story can honestly run. 964 of the two
# regions' people and signs say their piece; the rest stand there, as every one
# of them did before 2026-08-30.
#
# `make -C mmo import IMPORT_PKG=mods/hgss IMPORT_ROM=<your heartgold.nds>`

IPKE  region  johto  -
IPKE  region  kanto  -
